{title: Paper Boats}
{artist: Wren Hollis}

{start_of_verse: Verse}
[Am]Paper boats alo[F]ng the drain
[C]Sailing off in [G]April rain
[Am]Every one a lit[F]tle ship
[C]Every one a lit[G]tle trip
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus: Chorus}
[F]Float away, f[C]loat away
[G]Paper boats in t[Am]he rain
{end_of_chorus}
